      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "your asking for a dictionary to cache expensive formula? you can already do this with data dictionary's, or use the beta version of udon that has typed dicts, or you can even use arrays with your own hash function. you can also run on the gpu if your maths need to run the same thing alot, vrc added a way to get the data back nicely a while back",
